{"src":"en","tgt":"pt","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"pt","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":3882.4548400000003,"text":"It is thinner under the"},{"kind":"text","t":3991.1689619999997,"text":"É mais fino sob o"},{"kind":"audio","t":4045.704871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":4048.164586,"samples":1432,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":7393.038909000001,"text":"Maria and thicker under the highlands."},{"kind":"text","t":7572.309834,"text":"Maria e mais grosso sob as terras altas."},{"kind":"audio","t":7623.545999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7628.736935999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":7628.976812000001,"samples":3464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":14638.428727,"text":"During this period of European history, the Catholic Church, which had become rich and powerful,"},{"kind":"text","t":14996.414454000002,"text":"Durante este período da história europeia, a Igreja Católica, que se tornara rica e poderosa,"},{"kind":"audio","t":15059.357232999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15060.969830999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15062.752575999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15064.737717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":15064.855076,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17780.930662,"text":"came under scrutiny."},{"kind":"text","t":17937.856023,"text":"passou a ser questionada."},{"kind":"audio","t":17976.93938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17977.323044,"samples":11032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":24272.266664,"text":"Also to the north, visit the Great Sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima Shrine, a place of worldwide"},{"kind":"text","t":24695.945472,"text":"Também ao norte, visite o Santuário de Nossa Senhora de Fátima, um lugar de alcance mundial"},{"kind":"audio","t":24740.549781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24745.871466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24751.139291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24754.697791,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":31550.083563,"text":"According to Japan's nuclear agency, radioactive casein and iodine has been identified at the plant."},{"kind":"text","t":32008.062916000003,"text":"De acordo com a agência nuclear do Japão, césio e iodo radioativos foram identificados na usina."},{"kind":"audio","t":32064.32997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32065.888998000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32067.667303000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32069.919791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32070.473812999997,"samples":14728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":40586.002307,"text":"The document, according to the leak, will refer to the borders dispute, which Palestine wants based on the borders before the 1967 Mideast War."},{"kind":"text","t":41343.671881,"text":"O documento, de acordo com o vazamento, referir-se-á à disputa de fronteiras, que a Palestina deseja baseada nas fronteiras anteriores à Guerra do Oriente Médio de 1967."},{"kind":"audio","t":41425.190058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":41430.397604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41435.836258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41441.067453999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41446.451877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41451.802702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41456.88758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41460.122534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41460.563018,"samples":11456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":46940.743771,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. The local language is Romanian but Russian."},{"kind":"text","t":47188.528957,"text":"A capital da Moldávia é Chisinau. A língua local é o romeno, mas o russo."},{"kind":"audio","t":47238.823995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47241.739904,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":47275.180721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47279.112335,"samples":29632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":56068.837221,"text":"The other nominations include Best Picture, Director of Cinematography, Costume Design, Film Editing, Original Score,"},{"kind":"text","t":56511.810906,"text":"As outras indicações incluem Melhor Filme, Direção de Fotografia, Figurino, Montagem e Trilha Sonora Original,"},{"kind":"audio","t":56557.959614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56559.585111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56561.887948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56563.19642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":56564.663699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":56564.904615,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":61325.759052,"text":"production design, sound editing, sound mixing, and original screenplay."},{"kind":"text","t":61652.633179,"text":"direção de arte, edição de som, mixagem de som e roteiro original."},{"kind":"audio","t":61711.813212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61716.805701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61722.103046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":61722.406272,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67559.679785,"text":"Prior to the arrival of troops, Haiti had not encountered problems related to the disease since the 18th century."},{"kind":"text","t":67918.597249,"text":"Antes da chegada das tropas, o Haiti não enfrentava problemas relacionados à doença desde o século XVIII."},{"kind":"audio","t":67963.452054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67964.851354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67966.361633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67967.924621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67968.947696,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"input","t":75360.940571,"text":"With two years of the end of the war, the former allies were now enemies and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"text","t":75750.57124,"text":"A dois anos do fim da guerra, os antigos aliados eram agora inimigos e a Guerra Fria começou."},{"kind":"audio","t":75808.458511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75813.394241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75819.094221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75824.370846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":75824.648832,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85374.675815,"text":"In fact, it is not easy to find at all even if one knew it existed once inside the cave it is a total isolation"},{"kind":"text","t":85941.109814,"text":"Na verdade, não é nada fácil de encontrar, mesmo que se soubesse que existiu; uma vez dentro da caverna, é um isolamento total."},{"kind":"audio","t":85982.591977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85984.132495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85985.649164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85986.205236,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":86054.144255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86059.181894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":86059.952043,"samples":13064,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":98268.559215,"text":"Unfortunately, stunning traffic flow is difficult because driver behavior cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"text","t":98837.586917,"text":"Infelizmente, um fluxo de tráfego impressionante é difícil porque o comportamento do motorista não pode ser previsto com 100% de certeza."},{"kind":"audio","t":98918.72748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98920.169979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98922.014593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98923.919456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":98925.608412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98927.575514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98927.965059,"samples":17592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":108601.393336,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by lava from the Nyirangogo volcano, which buried most of the town's streets, particularly the town of Goma."},{"kind":"text","t":109302.037547,"text":"Em 2002, Goma foi destruída pela lava do vulcão Nyirangogo, que soterrou a maioria das ruas da cidade, particularmente a cidade de Goma."},{"kind":"audio","t":109365.320062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109370.659777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109375.693805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":109381.079929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109386.193457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":109391.489792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109391.746158,"samples":7992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":114626.65991,"text":"Rolando Mendoza fired his M16 rifle at the terrorist."},{"kind":"text","t":114907.830304,"text":"Rolando Mendoza disparou seu rifle M16 contra o terrorista."},{"kind":"audio","t":114962.611949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":114968.749192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114974.288554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":114974.57311,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":123391.031265,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":123744.951479,"text":"Se você não está acostumado a dirigir em estradas rurais, fique atento. Predominam inclinações acentuadas, vielas estreitas e curvas fechadas."},{"kind":"audio","t":123798.565501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123800.533123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123802.612544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":123802.84981,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":123826.474736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123828.025514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123829.617082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123829.900058,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":132545.103268,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":132967.279147,"text":"A maioria dos telescópios de pesquisa modernos são instalações enormes em áreas remotas com condições atmosféricas favoráveis."},{"kind":"audio","t":133020.893088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133025.98082599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133031.10943399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133036.561927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133041.859672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133046.442957,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":138549.99492899998,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":139006.03466900002,"text":"O suco de repolho muda de cor dependendo de quão ácido, básico ou alcalino o produto químico seja."},{"kind":"audio","t":139072.891694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139078.26469799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139083.30401700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139088.70734000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139089.91702300002,"samples":14728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":145372.18338200002,"text":"This offers a good opportunity to see the Aurora Borealis as the sky will be dark more or less around the time."},{"kind":"text","t":145827.83367800002,"text":"Isso oferece uma boa oportunidade de ver a Aurora Boreal, já que o céu estará escuro mais ou menos nessa época."},{"kind":"audio","t":145880.67930999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145885.852847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145891.045094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145896.45183699997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145899.95189800003,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":151622.82196899998,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":152015.626313,"text":"Portanto, é provável que a anotação tenha sido adicionada apenas como um rótulo."},{"kind":"audio","t":152057.597609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152060.972792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152066.343626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152067.68213700003,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":158531.466379,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egocentric, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"text","t":158905.902083,"text":"Os parisienses têm a reputação de serem egocêntricos, rudes e arrogantes."},{"kind":"audio","t":158959.998508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158965.20389399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":158970.49037999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158971.074961,"samples":12096,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":164533.364543,"text":"A curry is a dish based on herbs and spices together with either meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"text","t":164953.633479,"text":"Um curry é um prato à base de ervas e especiarias, acompanhado de carne ou vegetais."},{"kind":"audio","t":164998.11151000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165003.41725499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165008.633831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165012.797133,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"close","t":175705.92869799997,"code":1005}]}